WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:05.950
This final coding exercise combines several concepts
from the module You

00:00:05.976 --> 00:00:10.035
need to assign one of four outreach priorities Do
not contact Urgent

00:00:10.215 --> 00:00:16.029
Routine or Review Start with the most restrictive
rule If the patient

00:00:16.055 --> 00:00:20.075
is inactive or has explicitly refused contact the
result should be Do

00:00:20.088 --> 00:00:25.655
not contact Next comes the specific urgent condition
active consented high

00:00:25.681 --> 00:00:31.428
severity and no usable email After that the broader
active-and-consented group

00:00:31.454 --> 00:00:37.251
can become Routine Everything else becomes Review
Because

00:00:37.277 --> 00:00:42.879
the conditions overlap branch order is very
important Complete

00:00:42.905 --> 00:00:47.068
the case expression in the browser and select Run
and Check You

00:00:47.094 --> 00:00:50.909
can also copy the starter SQL into pgAdmin build it
one branch

00:00:50.922 --> 00:00:53.782
at a time and test the output there before
submitting it in

00:00:53.808 --> 00:00:54.414
the browser
